    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Callidus Assassin",
    "summary": "This unit can escape in 2 ways:\n\n- As [either player's Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) ends, while it is **[engaged](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range)**, it can fall back up to D6\" with a **[fall-back move](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back)**.\n- As your opponent's turn ends, while every enemy unit is over 3\" away from it, you can put this unit into **[strategic reserves](vsdata:core-rule/strategic-reserves)**. If you do, it has to arrive with an **[ingress move](vsdata:core-rule/ingress-move)** during [your next Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), even in your first turn.",
